I am running a SysV (HPUX) version of nethack 3.0 PATCHLEVEL_6 and have 
the problem of getting "5"s or "50"s on my screen when objects are thrown.
I understand that others have had this terminal problem in the past, but
it is the first time that I've seen it here.  I've compiled and played
all previous versions of 3.0 and haven't ever had this problem before.

Why does this occur and how does one fix it?  Below is an example of
a tourist throwing a dart in the "k" direction.

  ------
  |....|    )
  |.....  )5.
  |....|)5.
  |.f.)5.
  |.)5.+
  |<@..|
  ------

